{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f \u201cEveryone hides something.\u201d\u00a0\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But when the silence ties to survival, the truth begins to shake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">'<strong>A Place Where Summer Rain Falls</strong>' is a story-driven visual novel set in a rainy school, where hidden memories and quiet emotions unfold.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>The truth isn't always loud \u2014 sometimes, it's silent.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012450/extras/be806e874963e9073a44c0f31bb35c53.avif?t=1758013837\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f Features :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- \ud83d\udca0 Psychological drama with mystery elements\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- \ud83d\udca0EN/KR\u00a0Support for two languages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- \ud83d\udca0 8 main characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- \ud83d\udca0 Pixel art + illustrated cut-ins\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- \ud83d\udca0 Point and Click exploration\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- \ud83d\udca0 A quiet, melancholic world drowned in rain</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong